    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.direction.room-seventeen.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.asset.sprite.room-seventeen",
        "actorId": "room-seventeen",
        "slot": "center",
        "scale": "compact"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭の帰り、廊下に、あるはずのない扉があった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "真鍮の「17」の札が、提灯の色に照れている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……祭りの晩に、向こうから出てくるのは、珍しい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノックの前に、扉が開いた。中は——百階建てのもてなしでは、なかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "小さな部屋に、椅子が一脚、窓が一枚。それだけだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外に、前夜祭の灯りが一望で広がっていた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "机の上に、部屋の字で置き手紙があった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今夜だけの、特等席です。祭りは、歩いて疲れるものでもあるので」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……一日中、祝いの支度で歩き回っていたのを、見られていたらしい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "椅子に座ると、部屋がかすかに、良い温度になった。出口の扉は——開けっぱなしなのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉めましょうか、と聞いたら、壁の木目が少し揺れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「開けておくのが、うちの自慢なので」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年まで、出口を取り上げられていた部屋だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰かを閉じ込めるしかなかった部屋が、いまは、開けっぱなしの扉を自慢にしている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外で、花火が一輪、試し打ちで上がった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさん」部屋の声が、窓の桟をこつんと鳴らした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「明日、新しい闘技場が開きます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……私は、古い建物です。新しい子に、お客を取られてしまうでしょうか」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "即答した。「取られません」耳が、ちょっと得意げに立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「だって私、疲れた日は、結局ここへ来ます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "壁の木目が、今度は大きく波打った。部屋の照れ方としては、最大級なのだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、扉の外から「また来ます」の札を掛けた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いつもの儀式だ。札の裏に、今夜は部屋の字が足されていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「いつでも、どうぞ。あなたの部屋より」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.line.008d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.line.008d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……宛名の無い手紙より、ずっと強い一行だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.room-seventeen.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
